1
00:00:00,358 --> 00:00:02,919
Your happiest customers never leave a review.

2
00:00:03,013 --> 00:00:06,040
Your angriest one always does.

3
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:08,570
Problem one: you ask for reviews at

4
00:00:08,539 --> 00:00:09,610
the counter.

5
00:00:09,612 --> 00:00:10,970
Everyone says yes.

6
00:00:11,045 --> 00:00:12,650
Nobody does it.

7
00:00:12,717 --> 00:00:15,099
The fix: a thank-you message one hour

8
00:00:15,129 --> 00:00:17,419
later, with a one-tap review link.

9
00:00:17,749 --> 00:00:20,029
Problem two: one bad review sits at

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,309
the top for months.

11
00:00:21,858 --> 00:00:24,399
The fix: a steady flow of fresh

12
00:00:24,419 --> 00:00:27,199
reviews, so the real picture rises to

13
00:00:27,169 --> 00:00:27,760
the top.

14
00:00:28,155 --> 00:00:31,089
Problem three: an unhappy customer has nowhere

15
00:00:31,092 --> 00:00:34,049
to tell you, so they tell Google.

16
00:00:34,677 --> 00:00:37,699
The fix: low ratings come privately to

17
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:40,099
you first, so you can make it

18
00:00:40,116 --> 00:00:40,579
right.

19
00:00:40,716 --> 00:00:42,549
Ask at the right time, keep reviews

20
00:00:42,567 --> 00:00:44,629
fresh, and hear problems first.

21
00:00:45,285 --> 00:00:47,159
Want more five-star reviews?

22
00:00:47,179 --> 00:00:48,679
Comment STARS.

23
00:00:48,682 --> 00:00:50,039
We'll set it up for you.

